@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Create Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finalize Day 5 progress",
  "description": "Ship meaningful final improvements",
  "dueDate": "2026-03-01T15:00:00Z",
  "isHighUrgency": true
}

### Get Tasks (advanced query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?isCompleted=false&minPriorityScore=20&sortBy=dueDate&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/summary

### Get Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/notifications?count=20
